,"kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001273","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m062-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001273","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m062-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001273","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","book_id":"b-shiji-033","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:p074","text":"二十五年春，鸜鵒來巢。師己曰：『文成之世童謠曰「鸜鵒來巢，公在乾矦。鸜鵒入處，公在外野」。』","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m074-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"師己","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001279","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m074-0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"文","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001250","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-033-lu:m074-0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"成","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001270","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","book_id":"b-shiji-033","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-033-lu"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p104","text":"十三年，魯成公朝晉，晉弗敬，魯怒去，倍晉。晉伐鄭，取氾。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m104-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"魯成公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001270","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-033-lu","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-033","source_id":"s-shiji-033-lu","source":{"title":"史記／魯周公世家","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/魯周公世家","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/魯周公世家&oldid=7909289","revision_id":7909289,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"正文102個p區塊，自周公旦者至太史公論贊；排除導覽dd、現代版權告示及轉向頁。","image_ve